<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- Inco cut to hold from buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- Inco cut to hold from buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities cut its rating of nickel producer Inco Ltd to hold from buy, according to a source at the brokerage.</p>
<p>-- Shares were off 1/8 to 28-7/8 on the New York Stock Exchange in early trading.</p>
</text>
